WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:05.897
The Carters were on a trip.

2
00:00:05.898 --> 00:00:09.747
They were looking for their hotel.

3
00:00:09.748 --> 00:00:12.684
Harry checked his map.

4
00:00:12.685 --> 00:00:18.769
"We should turn left now," he said.

5
00:00:18.770 --> 00:00:22.926
"We don't need the map, Harry," said Mom.

6
00:00:22.927 --> 00:00:27.063
"My phone has a GPS.

7
00:00:27.064 --> 00:00:34.895
It will take us to our hotel."

8
00:00:34.896 --> 00:00:38.029
Harry sighed.

9
00:00:38.030 --> 00:00:46.749
He liked maps better than phones.

10
00:00:46.750 --> 00:00:53.835
The family checked into the hotel.

11
00:00:53.836 --> 00:00:57.649
"Time for sightseeing!" Dad said.

12
00:00:57.650 --> 00:01:01.870
"I can find the museum on my map," Harry said.

13
00:01:01.871 --> 00:01:11.725
"I'll use my phone," Mom said.

14
00:01:11.726 --> 00:01:17.245
Next they looked for the zoo.

15
00:01:17.246 --> 00:01:20.661
"I have my map," Harry said.

16
00:01:20.662 --> 00:01:31.146
"Maps take too long," Oliver said.

17
00:01:31.147 --> 00:01:34.588
After the zoo they went to a park.

18
00:01:34.589 --> 00:01:41.274
Everyone rested on a bench.

19
00:01:41.275 --> 00:01:45.180
Soon Mom turned on her phone again.

20
00:01:45.181 --> 00:01:52.477
"Let's go back to the hotel," she said.

21
00:01:52.478 --> 00:01:58.068
"Turn right," Mom said.

22
00:01:58.069 --> 00:02:04.109
"Now straight. And then . . ."

23
00:02:04.110 --> 00:02:07.659
Suddenly Mom's phone went dark.

24
00:02:07.660 --> 00:02:11.957
"Oh no!" Mom cried.

25
00:02:11.958 --> 00:02:17.183
"The battery is dead!" Dad said.

26
00:02:17.184 --> 00:02:21.238
"Where's our hotel?" Emmy asked.

27
00:02:21.239 --> 00:02:25.816
"I don't know," Dad said.

28
00:02:25.817 --> 00:02:35.458
"We're lost!" cried Oliver.

29
00:02:35.459 --> 00:02:39.532
Harry opened his map.

30
00:02:39.533 --> 00:02:43.959
"We have to walk along this street," he said.

31
00:02:43.960 --> 00:02:52.173
"Then we turn left two times."

32
00:02:52.174 --> 00:02:57.453
The family arrived back at the hotel.

33
00:02:57.454 --> 00:03:02.132
"I'm glad you brought a map, Harry!" said Mom.

34
00:03:02.133 --> 00:03:09.435
"Me too!" said Harry.

